{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13206030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13206030","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320603001:0":{"text":"ごきげんよう。何か用かな？","source_cn":"各位贵安。有什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4346751D04C4D203","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320603002:1":{"text":"リュボミルさん、荘園の隅でこの本を見つけたのですが、あなたの物ですか？","source_cn":"柳博米尔先生，我们在庄园角落发现了一本故事书。这是你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6A5A10915C0646D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:2::2":{"text":"落ちていた本","source_cn":"遗落的故事书","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A4F6A2C7B05C998","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320603003:0":{"text":"『メイジと冒険家』……ああ、これはラジノフ家の物で、今は僕のコレクションだ。","source_cn":"《魔法师与冒险家》……这是我的藏品之一。它原本属于拉季...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24DC5D586E89C5AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1320603003":{"text":"『メイジと冒険家』……ああ、これはラジノフ家の物で、今は僕のコレクションだ。","source_cn":"《魔法师与冒险家》……这是我的藏品之一。它原本属于拉季诺夫家族。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24DC5D586E89C5AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320603005:0":{"text":"生きていた頃、ラジノフ伯爵とは親しくしていてね、あの一族は魔法に長けており、敬虔なデューラ様の信者でもあった。","source_cn":"我生前与拉季诺夫伯爵私交甚密，他们一脉多有魔法天赋，也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99565928D46795C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320603006:0":{"text":"神魔大戦が終わった後も、魔物は依然としてこの地にはびこっていた。その中、ラジノフ家は率先して兵を率いて前線で魔物と戦った。","source_cn":"神魔大战结束后，魔物仍在冻土上横行，他们家族身先士卒，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x015815952A81A4E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320603007:0":{"text":"そして、一族は皆国のために犠牲になった。彼らは最後まで本物の貴族だったよ。この本は、何年も経った後に偶然見つけたんだ。","source_cn":"他们像真正的贵族那样陨落了，家族中最后的人也为国捐躯。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA8210D00D9C160A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320603008:0":{"text":"ラジノフ家は誰一人生き残っていない。だから僕はこれを買い取った。あの一族とあの時代の最後の記念としてね。","source_cn":"拉季诺夫家族早已覆灭，无人幸存。于是我购下它，当做对拉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1884E4C30EC7B06B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320603009:0":{"text":"待ってください！ロンロン、ラジノフの名前を見たことがあります！","source_cn":"等等，拉季诺夫……满满知道这个名字！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x503B3106137D9E9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320603010:0":{"text":"ホワイトマウンテン大聖堂の裏にある墓地で、カレリーナさんが隠し通路を案内してくれた時――","source_cn":"在白山大教堂后的墓园里，卡列琳娜带我们找密道的时候——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA856F112777A09D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320603011:0":{"text":"この墓の中を通って、主参道を真っすぐ進めば大聖堂の中へ入れます。","source_cn":"从这座墓穴下去，沿着主墓道一直向前，就可以通往大教堂内部。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1745FCC9ACFEB2CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320603012:1":{"text":"「カレリーナ・ラジノフ――雪の如く清らかな魂は、聖光の下で安らかに眠る」……","source_cn":"这墓志铭，“卡列琳娜·拉季诺夫——她安眠于圣光之下，灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB3EE65893B74382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320603013:1":{"text":"こ、これはカレリーナさんのお墓ですか？","source_cn":"咦，卡列琳娜，这、这是你的墓穴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC316EB6D2DD555B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320603014:1":{"text":"ええ、ですからどうぞお気になさらずお入りください。","source_cn":"没错，所以你们毋需担心惊扰亡者的灵魂，我并不在意这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7F39EDFB3212DCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320603015:0":{"text":"カレリーナ・ラジノフ！間違いありません！","source_cn":"——卡列琳娜，她的全名就是卡列琳娜·拉季诺夫！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4937EDF6BE6C4792","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320603016:1":{"text":"つまり、カレリーナさんと彼女のお兄さんはラジノフ家の人？","source_cn":"也就是说，她和她的哥哥，都是拉季诺夫家族的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFAA2C3119BB607F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320603017:1":{"text":"……兄？ラジノフの孫のゴーランか？","source_cn":"……哥哥？你是说拉季诺夫的长孙铐兰？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDECEC7C193A1FE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320603018:1":{"text":"はい。カレリーナさんはお兄様と呼んでいましたが、本人はほぼ意識がないようでした……","source_cn":"嗯，卡列琳娜管他叫哥哥，不过他好像没有多少自我意识了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA65387B1657E2CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320603019:1":{"text":"そうか、彼も……これが最も神を敬愛していたラジノフ家に、運命が用意した結末か。","source_cn":"是吗，他也……最虔诚敬神的拉季诺夫家族，最后竟然会迎来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F0B4A29D575EB36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1320603020:1":{"text":"修道院の近くにグレイヴボーンがいることは聞いていたが、それがラジノフ家の末裔だとは知らなかっ